00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:16.480
and stuff like that.

00:05:19.520 --> 00:05:20.410
You know, obviously,

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:22.440
when the shit hit the fan,

00:05:22.440 --> 00:05:24.190
