00:05:27.830 --> 00:05:28.663
And they were like, "Whoa!

00:05:28.663 --> 00:05:30.210
This shopping online shit's pretty nice.

00:05:30.210 --> 00:05:31.430
You know, I like this."

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:32.560
So now they're shopping online.

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:34.670
The buying volume has
increased significantly.

00:05:34.670 --> 00:05:36.838
I'd say five to 10 years

00:05:36.838 --> 00:05:39.850
