00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:40.230
This is a very consumer world.

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:41.683
People don't like saving.

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:47.790
And so the fundamentals are not exciting.

00:07:47.790 --> 00:07:50.910
You know, the timing of
when, I have no idea,

00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:55.670
