00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:41.430
And there's a million factors.

00:08:41.430 --> 00:08:43.153
The election's a huge factor.

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:46.020
You know, there's just, you know,

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:47.660
